OL,3,GNEWSAFlagship #85m road scheme at risk
OL,4,Aover funding gap
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn #84.6m scheme to try to solve
OL,7,Fserious traffic congestion in Coalville
OL,8,Fcould be scrapped because of a shortage
OL,9,Fof funding.
OL,11,FLeicestershire County Council has been
OL,12,Fplanning the A511 Growth Corridor
OL,13,Fproject since 2019 and had hoped to
OL,14,Fstart work on it early in 2027.
OL,16,FThe government has committed more than
OL,17,F#40m to the project, which would see
OL,18,Fpart of the road made into a dual
OL,19,Fcarriageway and work to increase the
OL,20,Fcapacity of key junctions in and around
OL,21,Fthe town.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
